WEBVTT

00:08.942 --> 00:16.983
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.983 --> 00:24.981
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.499 --> 00:36.302
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.302 --> 00:39.305
Believing, dreaming

00:39.305 --> 00:43.143
We are searching

00:43.143 --> 00:48.274
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:50.083 --> 00:58.491
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.491 --> 01:03.063
For the color of the world to change?

01:03.063 --> 01:05.732
Ah, surely someday

01:05.732 --> 01:14.007
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:14.007 --> 01:18.967
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.513 --> 01:27.146
Let's begin our journey

01:32.158 --> 01:33.420
What's that?!

01:42.068 --> 01:43.535
Freya...

01:49.008 --> 01:50.305
Loki...

01:53.046 --> 01:58.746
The 7th Night
The Goddess Freya Awakens!

02:04.858 --> 02:06.860
Coming to, are you?

02:06.860 --> 02:08.461
It's you...

02:08.461 --> 02:10.330
Where is Miss Reiya?

02:10.330 --> 02:11.558
Well...

02:17.137 --> 02:18.304
Not here, huh?

02:18.304 --> 02:19.472
Vanished without a trace.

02:19.472 --> 02:23.476
Loki, why did Heimdall awaken Freya?

02:23.476 --> 02:25.245
To kill me, probably.

02:25.245 --> 02:28.009
You dope! How can you say
that so nonchalantly?!

02:28.314 --> 02:30.817
It couldn't be anything else, could it?

02:30.817 --> 02:34.014
I mean, that's why you came here.

02:42.862 --> 02:44.764
What is it? A feather?

02:44.764 --> 02:45.890
From Heimdall?

02:52.739 --> 02:54.172
Is that...

02:55.408 --> 02:57.672
It seems like some kid of hint.

02:58.011 --> 03:03.149
Narugami, do you know of a
building with this shape?

03:03.149 --> 03:04.446
A building?

03:05.018 --> 03:06.451
Because that...

03:07.020 --> 03:08.321
is where Freya is.

03:08.321 --> 03:09.447
What?!

03:11.457 --> 03:12.525
Master Loki!

03:12.525 --> 03:13.651
Yamino!

03:14.093 --> 03:15.328
Are you all right?

03:15.328 --> 03:16.596
Thanks to you...

03:16.596 --> 03:18.598
Have you heard about Reiya?

03:18.598 --> 03:21.568
Yes, that she suddenly
vanished somewhere.

03:21.568 --> 03:23.703
But will she be all right?

03:23.703 --> 03:25.534
She'll be fine.

03:25.972 --> 03:29.108
For now, just leave this
matter in our hands.

03:29.108 --> 03:30.944
We'll make sure to bring her back to you.

03:30.944 --> 03:32.579
Thank you for your help.

03:32.579 --> 03:36.349
Reiya's story turned out
to be true after all.

03:36.349 --> 03:39.512
If only I had taken her more seriously...

03:40.153 --> 03:41.552
Mr. Mino...

03:42.355 --> 03:43.982
By the way, Yamino...

03:44.324 --> 03:45.382
Yes?

03:46.693 --> 03:48.160
What is that?

03:49.495 --> 03:52.521
When you and Narugami were
hurrying toward the tower...

03:52.966 --> 03:54.167
Hurry!

03:54.167 --> 03:55.268
Yeah!

03:55.268 --> 03:57.702
Wait up, Loki!

03:58.338 --> 04:01.637
Hey, so who's Freya? Loki!

04:01.975 --> 04:02.976
Okay!

04:02.976 --> 04:05.511
If that's how it is...

04:05.511 --> 04:09.447
Mayura Turbo Dash!

04:14.721 --> 04:15.788
I see.

04:15.788 --> 04:17.457
Shall I wake her?

04:17.457 --> 04:19.118
No, just leave her be.

04:20.026 --> 04:23.296
I just remembered what building
has that shape!

04:23.296 --> 04:24.456
Really?

04:33.773 --> 04:36.142
The aquarium, huh?

04:36.142 --> 04:38.007
Looks like it's closed today.

04:38.678 --> 04:40.780
Thanks, Narugami.

04:40.780 --> 04:42.915
We'll take care of it from here.

04:42.915 --> 04:45.285
Hey, I came this far, I ain't
turning back now!

04:45.285 --> 04:47.787
So you're coming with us?

04:47.787 --> 04:49.880
Well, you're not such a bad guy
after all, are you?

04:51.224 --> 04:52.659
Get outta here!

04:52.659 --> 04:56.390
I just hate leaving things half-done.

04:56.696 --> 04:58.398
Blushing again, are you?

04:58.398 --> 04:59.558
Shaddup!

05:07.340 --> 05:09.709
There is no evil in this building.
Let's go.

05:09.709 --> 05:10.573
All right.

05:15.481 --> 05:17.073
What a disaster!

05:17.383 --> 05:21.080
We were too late...
We were too late, Gullinbursti!

05:23.189 --> 05:27.387
My beloved sister has already
vanished into thin air!

05:27.927 --> 05:30.953
Come back, my sister!

05:35.001 --> 05:36.969
Looking for Freya

05:37.403 --> 05:40.372
Your brother is so lonely, Freya!

05:41.274 --> 05:43.843
I know, Gullinbursti.

05:43.843 --> 05:45.845
If I give up over something like this,

05:45.845 --> 05:48.548
the name "Mysterious Thief Frey"
will fall into obsolescence!

05:48.548 --> 05:49.816
Hang in there, Frey!

05:49.816 --> 05:51.613
Suck it up, Frey!

05:53.486 --> 05:56.055
Okay! Let's go, Gullinbursti!

05:56.055 --> 05:58.353
Let's look for my sister Freya...

06:02.028 --> 06:06.226
Ow... This is definitely not my night.

06:08.701 --> 06:09.802
Huh?

06:09.802 --> 06:12.635
What do you think this is, Gullinbursti?

06:16.876 --> 06:20.676
Come to think of it, have you asked
Mr. Mino about the matter in question?

06:20.947 --> 06:26.986
Yes. It seems there was definitely a
person named Reiya Oshima.

06:26.986 --> 06:28.287
"Was"?

06:28.287 --> 06:29.956
Yes.

06:29.956 --> 06:32.925
She was daughter of the head of
the Oshima Corporation...

06:32.925 --> 06:36.520
But last year, she and her parents
were in an unfortunate accident.

06:37.029 --> 06:39.429
Their remains were not found.

06:40.833 --> 06:43.631
But, several days later...

06:56.749 --> 06:58.376
Milady!

06:59.552 --> 07:00.887
Milady!

07:00.887 --> 07:03.756
Please hang on, milady!

07:03.756 --> 07:05.383
Milady!

07:05.892 --> 07:08.053
So Reiya was the only one to come back?

07:08.728 --> 07:11.196
That is when she was replaced, wasn't it?

07:12.965 --> 07:14.634
A fork, huh?

07:14.634 --> 07:16.836
Okay, so we split up and search?

07:16.836 --> 07:18.004
Let's do that.

07:18.004 --> 07:19.906
Fine, I'll go this way.

07:19.906 --> 07:21.507
Why right?

07:21.507 --> 07:23.075
Because I'm right-handed.

07:23.075 --> 07:24.076
Ah, I see.

07:24.076 --> 07:26.271
Am I missing something here?

07:26.879 --> 07:29.182
I'm right-handed, so I'm goin' right.

07:29.182 --> 07:31.446
Fine! I understand...

07:33.653 --> 07:35.655
Okay, we'll go this way.

07:35.655 --> 07:38.556
Thor is pretty scary.

07:38.791 --> 07:41.817
This is what you get when you try
to deal with him seriously.

07:42.795 --> 07:43.930
What is it?

07:43.930 --> 07:46.232
Don't tell me you've found Freya!

07:46.232 --> 07:48.029
Sea otters!

07:49.702 --> 07:51.966
This is the first time I've
seen them in real life!

07:52.538 --> 07:54.974
They're bigger than I'd imagined.

07:54.974 --> 07:57.499
Master Loki, do we really
have time for this?

07:58.044 --> 08:00.413
It... It...

08:00.413 --> 08:00.680
Pays 1000 yen an hour?!

08:00.680 --> 08:02.281
Part time
Help Wanted!
¥1000/Hr.
Pays 1000 yen an hour?!

08:02.281 --> 08:04.050
Part time
Help Wanted!
¥1000/Hr.
With this kind of money, I could
order two bowls of gyudon

08:04.050 --> 08:05.518
Part time
Help Wanted!
¥1000/Hr.
And have them throw in some egg
and miso soup too!

08:05.518 --> 08:05.852
And have them throw in some egg
and miso soup too!

08:05.852 --> 08:07.420
It's almost too good to be true!

08:07.420 --> 08:08.853
Fabulous!

08:09.088 --> 08:12.191
I want to do that job!
I wish they'd let me...

08:12.191 --> 08:12.925
But...

08:12.925 --> 08:13.192
Note:
Female applicants only
But...

08:13.192 --> 08:15.428
Note:
Female applicants only
"However, female applicants only."

08:16.462 --> 08:17.895
Why?!

08:18.764 --> 08:20.700
Have the heavens forsaken me?!

08:20.700 --> 08:22.827
Oh, God...

08:27.974 --> 08:28.998
What was that?

08:34.413 --> 08:35.348
Freya!

08:35.348 --> 08:36.282
Master Loki!

08:36.282 --> 08:37.249
Freya...

08:37.850 --> 08:38.951
Freya, hang in there.

08:38.951 --> 08:39.918
Loki!

08:43.456 --> 08:45.057
No! Let go of me, Heimdall!

08:45.057 --> 08:45.725
Calm down, Freya!
No! Let go of me, Heimdall!

08:45.725 --> 08:47.056
Calm down, Freya!

08:47.760 --> 08:49.227
Freya...

08:50.930 --> 08:51.931
Who are you?

08:51.931 --> 08:53.296
Master Loki.

08:54.100 --> 08:55.465
Loki?

08:56.002 --> 08:58.698
That's right, Freya. It's me.

08:59.038 --> 09:01.632
Loki... Is it really you?

09:02.275 --> 09:03.572
Loki...

09:04.477 --> 09:05.876
Really?

09:06.112 --> 09:07.238
Loki!

09:07.980 --> 09:10.949
How I've longed to see you...
I've longed to see you, Loki.

09:11.250 --> 09:13.411
What is going on here?

09:14.887 --> 09:17.014
You were being chased by Heimdall?

09:18.257 --> 09:19.458
Yes.

09:19.458 --> 09:24.297
He said if I didn't follow his orders,
then he'd force me to obey.

09:24.297 --> 09:25.831
And what were his orders?

09:25.831 --> 09:26.991
Well...

09:27.433 --> 09:30.891
He told you to kill me, didn't he?

09:32.271 --> 09:33.397
Yes.

09:34.440 --> 09:37.136
But you couldn't do it, could you?

09:37.643 --> 09:40.580
Why would Heimdall want you to kill Loki?

09:40.580 --> 09:44.550
Because it's your fault Freya
lost her memories

09:44.550 --> 09:46.814
and was trapped in the form of a child.

09:50.990 --> 09:52.321
Heimdall...

09:52.692 --> 09:55.320
I've been looking for you, Freya.

10:13.379 --> 10:15.214
Now, then Freya...

10:15.214 --> 10:16.841
Kill Loki!

10:18.317 --> 10:21.087
Free yourself of the resentment you bear
for having been turned into a child

10:21.087 --> 10:22.554
and robbed of your memories.

10:27.259 --> 10:28.561
That's ridiculous!

10:28.561 --> 10:31.325
Yeah! Loki doesn't have that kind of power!

10:32.064 --> 10:34.532
You don't get it, do you?

10:34.867 --> 10:36.232
What did you say?

10:36.636 --> 10:39.939
Freya, what I've said is the truth.

10:39.939 --> 10:42.271
Loki is your enemy.

10:42.541 --> 10:44.065
Help me, Loki!

10:45.011 --> 10:46.137
Freya!

10:46.612 --> 10:48.079
Loki, get out of here!

10:48.347 --> 10:50.178
Hurry, take Freya and go!

10:50.483 --> 10:52.644
Oh, no you don't!

10:59.792 --> 11:01.919
What are you waiting for?
Hurry up and go!

11:04.997 --> 11:06.521
I won't let you get away!

11:09.035 --> 11:11.003
Playtime is over!

11:22.682 --> 11:23.808
Are you okay?

11:33.826 --> 11:35.293
Just leave the fighting to me!

11:36.862 --> 11:40.298
C'mon, show me what ya got, Heimdall!

11:44.603 --> 11:46.298
What's so funny?

11:46.872 --> 11:49.841
You truly are a couple of simpletons.

11:53.846 --> 11:56.246
I've wanted to see you for so long...

11:56.549 --> 11:59.848
I'm glad I didn't allow myself to
become Heimdall's servant.

12:06.058 --> 12:08.856
Loki, I...

12:10.396 --> 12:11.693
I...

12:17.236 --> 12:20.569
Freya despises Loki.

12:23.209 --> 12:25.905
And the sentiment runs deep.

12:26.412 --> 12:27.640
What?

12:32.952 --> 12:34.954
Right about now,

12:34.954 --> 12:38.082
those two should be all alone together,
with no one else to get in the way.

12:38.491 --> 12:42.161
Then by fighting us you were really...

12:42.161 --> 12:44.288
Keeping us away from them.

12:44.497 --> 12:46.999
You've figured it out, but it's too
late to do anything now!

12:46.999 --> 12:48.267
Four-Eyes!

12:48.267 --> 12:49.335
Uh... yes?

12:49.335 --> 12:52.133
Hurry and find Loki! I'll take care of him.

12:53.038 --> 12:54.505
You think I'll let you go?

12:56.275 --> 12:57.435
Damn!

12:58.043 --> 12:59.545
Not so fast!

12:59.545 --> 13:00.944
No matter.

13:01.313 --> 13:03.082
Even if he does make it in time,

13:03.082 --> 13:05.710
it should prove to be quite interesting.

13:06.218 --> 13:07.412
Loki...

13:07.887 --> 13:09.514
I love you.

13:10.823 --> 13:12.450
I love you so much.

13:13.993 --> 13:15.085
Truly...

13:17.263 --> 13:19.231
So much that I could kill you.

13:21.700 --> 13:23.327
Okay, that's far enough.

13:26.705 --> 13:29.640
You've been possessed by evil,
haven't you, Freya?

13:30.242 --> 13:32.870
I realized it as soon as we met.

13:34.713 --> 13:36.816
Come on, drop that.

13:36.816 --> 13:38.818
I don't want to hurt you.

13:38.818 --> 13:40.445
You're too late!

13:41.654 --> 13:44.890
I have already been to see Odin.

13:44.890 --> 13:48.327
I went to him, begging to allow you
to return to the world of the gods

13:48.327 --> 13:49.954
from which you have been exiled.

13:51.664 --> 13:54.767
Odin became enraged and...

13:54.767 --> 13:57.998
And turned you into a child,
and even stole your memories.

14:01.707 --> 14:04.835
I was in love with you.

14:05.711 --> 14:08.680
I loved you from the bottom of my heart!

14:11.851 --> 14:14.319
But I knew...

14:15.020 --> 14:17.818
That you weren't aware of my feelings.

14:19.024 --> 14:23.586
I loved you so much, but you
wouldn't even take notice of me.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.224
I was so lonely!

14:31.303 --> 14:35.433
I would have been better off
never falling in love with you!

14:36.108 --> 14:41.705
Then I would never have incurred
the wrath of Odin.

14:42.114 --> 14:44.241
I wouldn't have suffered as I have.

14:48.754 --> 14:50.551
I despise you!

14:51.257 --> 14:53.054
I can never forgive you!

14:54.360 --> 14:55.452
Loki!

15:02.368 --> 15:03.426
Freya.

15:04.169 --> 15:05.636
I...

15:14.179 --> 15:15.806
Master Loki!

15:15.948 --> 15:17.116
Yamino?

15:17.116 --> 15:18.583
Are you all right?

15:32.298 --> 15:33.424
Yamino!

15:36.535 --> 15:37.536
Are you okay?

15:37.536 --> 15:38.503
Yes.

15:52.451 --> 15:54.919
Freya, I...

15:57.356 --> 15:59.024
Yamino, what are you doing?!

15:59.024 --> 16:01.293
It's not what you think!
My hands are moving on their own!

16:01.293 --> 16:03.195
Hey, stop it, hands!

16:03.195 --> 16:04.890
Let go of Master Loki now!

16:05.097 --> 16:06.564
A fitting end.

16:10.769 --> 16:12.236
Master Loki!

16:18.310 --> 16:20.938
Farewell, Loki.

16:28.687 --> 16:30.052
Ow...

16:31.924 --> 16:34.226
That won't do, Gullinbursti.

16:34.226 --> 16:36.524
You need to land more gently!

16:42.001 --> 16:43.525
Ah! Loki!

16:44.003 --> 16:45.368
I didn't expect to see you...

16:50.075 --> 16:52.511
Are you all right, Master Loki?

16:52.511 --> 16:53.842
Uh... yeah.

16:57.416 --> 16:58.781
Reiya!

17:03.255 --> 17:04.984
I was so lonely!

17:10.229 --> 17:11.753
What's all the racket?

17:12.498 --> 17:13.624
Frey!

17:15.034 --> 17:16.365
What's going on here?

17:16.902 --> 17:18.460
This is what's going on.

17:44.129 --> 17:45.898
The evil has been eliminated.

17:45.898 --> 17:47.866
Too bad for you, huh?

17:50.102 --> 17:53.003
Your little plan has failed.
Give it up, Heimdall.

17:58.644 --> 18:01.010
I won't give up, Loki!

18:02.548 --> 18:05.150
I will destroy you no matter what!

18:05.150 --> 18:06.617
No matter what!

18:08.520 --> 18:09.987
Mark my words!

18:10.289 --> 18:12.655
Damn! He just never learns.

18:14.560 --> 18:17.290
So she's returned to her other form?

18:17.696 --> 18:18.822
Yeah.

18:20.599 --> 18:22.066
Freya...

18:26.071 --> 18:27.663
Shall we head back?

18:36.682 --> 18:40.419
I can't even begin to express my gratitude.

18:40.419 --> 18:42.853
We're happy for you.

18:43.255 --> 18:46.952
We're glad everything turned out all right.
My sincerest thanks to you both.

18:47.626 --> 18:49.116
How cute!

18:50.796 --> 18:52.297
You can see it?

18:52.297 --> 18:53.924
Huh? Well, yes!

18:54.766 --> 18:57.436
What does she mean? See what?

18:57.436 --> 18:59.961
Uh, nothing! It's kind of a long story.

19:00.672 --> 19:03.800
Um, so Loki...

19:04.309 --> 19:05.776
Yeah?

19:06.345 --> 19:11.214
Would it be okay if I came and
visited you sometime?

19:11.583 --> 19:13.252
Yes, certainly!

19:13.252 --> 19:14.981
You're most welcome.

19:17.089 --> 19:18.886
Thank you!

19:19.591 --> 19:21.827
Well, now. That's very nice, isn't it?

19:21.827 --> 19:23.055
Yes!

19:25.597 --> 19:27.565
Ah, there you are!

19:29.001 --> 19:32.571
Geez, I was so surprised when I woke up
and found myself at home!

19:32.571 --> 19:35.307
So, hey, what happened with that
big flash of light last night?

19:35.307 --> 19:37.798
What was that, Loki?

19:39.044 --> 19:41.613
Hey, Loki! Look at me when
I'm talking to you.

19:41.613 --> 19:43.513
Don't make me feel lonely!

19:45.083 --> 19:46.710
You're right.

19:47.085 --> 19:48.353
I'm sorry.

19:48.353 --> 19:49.288
Huh?

19:49.288 --> 19:52.849
Uh, well, I wasn't really looking for
an apology or anything.

20:00.232 --> 20:01.699
What do you want?

20:02.401 --> 20:04.937
Try one of these. They're good.

20:04.937 --> 20:06.505
No thanks.

20:06.505 --> 20:11.476
Tasty foods are the best fix for when
you're having a tough time!

20:11.476 --> 20:13.205
Tough time? Whose fault is that?

20:15.948 --> 20:18.016
This is hard on me too.

20:18.016 --> 20:19.251
Huh?

20:19.251 --> 20:23.711
I wasn't able to find my dearest
sister this time, either.

20:26.592 --> 20:29.261
But I must not lose heart!

20:29.261 --> 20:31.263
Hang in there, Frey!

20:31.263 --> 20:33.163
Suck it up, Frey!

20:38.303 --> 20:40.973
This particular bakery puts the sweet
bean jam all the way into the tail.

20:40.973 --> 20:42.600
They're delicious!

20:43.308 --> 20:45.510
You got them from Azuma's Kitchen, right?

20:45.510 --> 20:46.977
I know the place.

20:54.720 --> 20:59.725
I see. So that light was from a TV show!

20:59.725 --> 21:02.294
Yes. They were doing location
shooting for Escape Magic.

21:02.294 --> 21:04.496
Well that's no fun!

21:04.496 --> 21:06.565
I thought for sure it was like
Samurai Resurrection

21:06.565 --> 21:09.159
or an alien invasion or something.

21:09.968 --> 21:12.493
Oh, and one more thing: Who's this "Freya"?

21:13.305 --> 21:14.772
Who knows?

21:16.074 --> 21:17.871
You're such a wet blanket!

21:28.320 --> 21:30.889
The evil has been removed.

21:30.889 --> 21:32.356
But...

21:55.280 --> 21:58.408
I'm sorry, Freya.

22:17.069 --> 22:29.038
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.749 --> 22:42.494
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.494 --> 22:49.601
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.601 --> 22:56.041
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:56.041 --> 23:05.550
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.550 --> 23:09.888
Even if we're hurt

23:09.888 --> 23:21.900
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.900 --> 23:23.629
Believe in Heaven

23:31.410 --> 23:32.577
Next Episode

23:32.577 --> 23:34.045
Next Episode
The next episode's key words are,

